  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Setup and write",
      "items": [
        "Discovery is off-chain: page providers(offset, limit) from the runtime API and rank by stake, price and stats yourself",
        "A quote has no price and no version. Read ProviderInfoResponse.version and pass it as expected_version to create_bucket_with_primary, add_primary_provider, add_replica_provider, extend_agreement, top_up_agreement and create_replacement; ProviderVersionMismatch means the provider worsened its terms",
        "The quote nonce is the owner's AgreementNonces value; one quote per nonce is redeemable, NonceMismatch otherwise",
        "Create the bucket with create_bucket_with_primary, or create_bucket then add_primary_provider",
        "Primaries do not sync with each other: upload to every primary",
        "Keep the provider_signatures from POST /commit: they are the evidence for challenge_offchain",
        "checkpoint takes (AccountId, Signature) pairs from GET /checkpoint-signature for at least min_providers signing slots, the consistency_proof from one primary for an append, and activate_replacements (false unless you activate a pending replacement)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Challenge modes",
      "items": [
        "challenge_offchain: with a commit signature; for buckets with frequent writes",
        "challenge_checkpoint: against the on-chain snapshot; for cold buckets",
        "challenge_replica: against the root a replica confirmed on-chain",
        "The provider has ChallengeTimeout to respond; an invalid response is rejected and the challenge stays open (12 Challenge protocol)",
        "Only a timeout slashes: anyone calls resolve_expired_challenge after the deadline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Keep the data stored",
      "items": [
        "extend_agreement before expiry; end_agreement Pay or Burn within SettlementTimeout",
        "add_replica_provider with a replica quote for more redundancy",
        "Change a primary: add the new one, upload, checkpoint with its signature (14 Changing a primary provider)"
      ]
    }
  ]
